Modifications in this repository
--------------------------------

- Patched muse2api for canvas-compatible multipart video requests, multiple
  image generations, and reference image fields.
- Added server-side provider locking, Agent locking, and runtime config
  injection.
- Added canvas_server.py, install.sh, Supervisor/Nginx examples, and
  bilingual documentation.

